Package: PhenoRec
Type: Package
Title: Phenotype-Preserving Integration of Single-Cell Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Chao",
        family = "Deng",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "deng_chao@sjtu.edu.cn"
    )
Description:
    Provides methods for phenotype-preserving integration of single-cell
    data. PhenoRec models cell-state, phenotype-associated, and batch-associated
    variation and recovers phenotype signals that may be removed during
    conventional single-cell data integration. The package supports Gaussian
    and Bernoulli measurements for applications including single-cell RNA-seq
    and single-cell ATAC-seq data.
